      "text": "Watching from Brisbane Australia. Sitting and watching this horror of a life makes me ever so thankful for the little things in my life……my pups(3) who have a huge yard to run around in…..my elegant and much loved garden…. A space of quiet and silence to enjoy the sunshine and nurture my living plants.  My car parked in my garage, my surety of three meals a day, my children and grandchildren, all set up I. Their own homes and healthy and happy.  Wow I am 79 year old lady and I should each day thank my god for the blessings I have. When we watch people’s in the world who have nothing and it’s a struggle to get thru each day. I so wish I could share atleast a little of what I have taken for granted all my life. Shame on me!!!",
